- `logs/2026-11-03.md`: a new section for this run.
- `logs/run-2026-11-03.log` was already changed before I started.

I didn't create any new files in the `釣り` folder. A copy of the data file from before my changes is at `%TEMP%\t1103b\catch-log.backup.js`. As step 9 says, `run-collect.ps1` rebuilds the HTML pages after this, so I didn't touch them.

